&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;3401&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hppftc&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2750&quot;&gt;8+ years of Talent Acquisition experience, including leadership experience in a high-growth B2B SaaS or enterprise technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j7bgb&quot; data-start=&quot;2752&quot; data-end=&quot;2889&quot;&gt;Experience hiring across both go-to-market and technical organizations, with credibility in commercial and specialized technical hiring&lt;/li&gt;
