&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c22c87&quot; data-start=&quot;3640&quot; data-end=&quot;3740&quot;&gt;A builder who is comfortable creating, redesigning, and scaling functions in changing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vu2mur&quot; data-start=&quot;3742&quot; data-end=&quot;3787&quot;&gt;Data-driven, pragmatic, and action-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5z6c2u&quot; data-start=&quot;3789&quot; data-end=&quot;3878&quot;&gt;A strong people leader who develops teams, raises standards, and creates accountability&lt;/li&gt;
