&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your first two weeks, you have met every key hiring manager, reviewed all open roles, and have a clear point of view on where the biggest gaps and opportunities are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your first month, you are actively recruiting on priority roles, have identified at least one AI tool or workflow change to implement, and have presented a TA operating model to the VP of Experience and Communications&lt;/li&gt;
