&lt;li&gt;Procurement Operations and category Ownership: Managing category spend across G&amp;amp;A, product, and engineering functions, acting as the primary point of contact for vendor relationships and spend decisions within these categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor Lifecycle Management: Overseeing the full vendor lifecycle — including intake, review, redlining, and renewal — to ensure contracts are executed efficiently and aligned with business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invoice Validation &amp;amp; Exception Handling: Reviewing and validating invoices, resolving discrepancies, and managing exceptions to ensure timely and accurate payment processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;P-Card Program Administration: Administering the corporate purchasing card program, including policy compliance, reconciliation oversight, and employee guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor Management &amp;amp; Contract Execution: Leading review and contract execution for vendors, ensuring favorable terms and adherence to procurement standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional Partnership: Collaborating closely with P&amp;amp;E, Finance, Legal, IT, HR, and Facilities teams to align procurement operations with organizational needs and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
