&lt;p&gt;The Federal Enterprise Architect will work closely with customers at various stages of their Data maturity journey, from land to expansion to renewals. This is an exciting opportunity to work with large enterprises across the Federal business to support their roadmap and data programs with Collibra.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Federal Enterprise Architects at Collibra are responsible for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
