&lt;li&gt;Within your third month, you’ll independently execute assigned tasks accurately, demonstrating understanding of core platform technologies (Cloud, K8s, IaC, GitOps) and team workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your sixth month, you will be participating in key automation initiatives, alongside delivering reliable mid-complexity infrastructure improvements, driving towards reduction of complexity through refactoring existing automations.&lt;/li&gt;
